{
  "uid": "spark-alerts",
  "title": "Spark alerts",
  "description": "Every Prometheus alerting rule this box loads, what is firing, and when things fired before. Provisioned from roles/monitoring/files/dashboards/spark-alerts.json.",
  "tags": [
    "spark",
    "alerts"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Firing now",
      "description": "Prometheus alerting rules in the firing state. Zero is the expected reading. Nothing routes these: there is no Alertmanager on this box, so this page and Prometheus are where they surface.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "firing",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "What is firing",
      "description": "One row per firing alert, with the labels the rule attached. `severity` is the rule's own judgement: critical means the box is not doing what it should, warning means it will stop being able to. A single row reading `nothing firing` is the healthy state, not a missing panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"} or label_replace(vector(0), \"alertname\", \"nothing firing\", \"\", \"\")",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "alertstate": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "When they fired",
      "description": "What the Alerting page cannot tell you: whether the box went into the USB-PD safety mode at three in the morning and came back. `ALERTS` is an ordinary time series, so it has history for as long as Prometheus retention holds it, which is a year here.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "quiet",
                  "color": "dark-green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "firing",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or label_replace(vector(0), \"alertname\", \"nothing firing\", \"\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Nothing notifies you",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These rules are **evaluated, not routed.** There is no Alertmanager on this box, so nothing emails, pages or notifies. Firing means a series exists saying so, and someone has to look at it: here, or on the status strip of [Spark overview](/d/spark-overview/spark-overview).\n\nOther views of the same rules:\n\n- **Grafana's own list**, with each rule's expression: [Alerting \u2192 Alert rules](/alerting/list). The `Grafana-managed` section is empty and always will be; ours are under `Prometheus`.\n- **Prometheus at `/alerts`**, which is bound to loopback on the box. Reach it with `ssh -L 9090:127.0.0.1:9090 <box>` and open `http://127.0.0.1:9090/alerts`.\n\nThe rules themselves live in `roles/monitoring/files/rules/spark.yml`, and `make alerts` proves they fire on the condition they describe."
      }
    }
  ]
}
